WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.979 --> 00:00:15.020
helped the man to the monastery.

2
00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:19.761
When they arrived, Vinnie noticed a building in front.

3
00:00:21.181 --> 00:00:23.482
It looked like the one in the photo.

4
00:00:23.502 --> 00:00:26.002
"Won't you come inside?"

5
00:00:26.803 --> 00:00:27.563
asked the man.

6
00:00:27.583 --> 00:00:31.644
"What are these things called?"

7
00:00:32.324 --> 00:00:34.785
Vinnie asked, pointing to the building.

8
00:00:34.805 --> 00:00:38.167
"Pagodas," the man replied.

9
00:00:38.187 --> 00:00:41.368
"They are places to worship Buddha."

10
00:00:43.249 --> 00:00:44.629
"Teacher Hu, you are hurt!"

11
00:00:45.310 --> 00:00:46.410
a young man cried.

12
00:00:47.511 --> 00:00:49.371
He walked quickly over to them.

13
00:00:49.391 --> 00:00:51.932
"I am fine.

14
00:00:52.353 --> 00:00:54.373
My young friend helped me here, Sheng."

15
00:00:55.614 --> 00:01:03.902
Teacher Hu introduced his student to Vinnie and then said, "Let's thank Vinnie by showing him around."

16
00:01:05.463 --> 00:01:08.466
The monastery was very quiet and peaceful.

17
00:01:09.687 --> 00:01:13.750
Inside one temple was a very large statue of Buddha.

18
00:01:14.811 --> 00:01:16.793
There were candles burning around it.

19
00:01:16.813 --> 00:01:22.317
"Ah, I must stop and rest," said Teacher Hu.

20
00:01:22.337 --> 00:01:25.720
"Sheng will answer all your questions, Vinnie."

21
00:01:26.921 --> 00:01:30.644
Teacher Hu spoke quietly to his student for a moment.

22
00:01:32.156 --> 00:01:35.979
While the two men were talking, Vinnie took out the photo.

23
00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:39.342
The picture was not glowing blue.

24
00:01:39.362 --> 00:01:43.966
"It's not this place then," he said to himself.

25
00:01:43.986 --> 00:01:46.608
"What are you looking at?"

26
00:01:47.348 --> 00:01:48.049
asked Sheng.

27
00:01:48.069 --> 00:01:51.371
"Oh, nothing," Vinnie said.

28
00:01:52.492 --> 00:01:55.014
He shoved the photo back into his pocket.

29
00:01:55.034 --> 00:01:58.637
"Are there many pagodas in Chang'an?"

30
00:01:59.658 --> 00:02:03.228
"Quite a few," replied Sheng.

31
00:02:03.248 --> 00:02:08.031
"I'm looking for one with animal statues in front of it," Vinnie began.

32
00:02:09.192 --> 00:02:11.594
Sheng stared at him, confused.

33
00:02:12.875 --> 00:02:16.977
"The statues have sharp teeth and big eyes," said Vinnie.

34
00:02:16.997 --> 00:02:21.580
"Oh, you mean the Giant Wild Goose Pagoda!"

35
00:02:22.341 --> 00:02:23.141
cried Sheng.

36
00:02:24.582 --> 00:02:28.445
Back in the street, Mandy held on tightly to the monkey.

37
00:02:29.686 --> 00:02:32.608
The trainer was coming toward them on his horse.

38
00:02:33.888 --> 00:02:36.049
"Jinying! He's getting close!"

39
00:02:36.910 --> 00:02:37.770
Mandy cried.

40
00:02:39.591 --> 00:02:42.973
Mandy and Jinying ran down the busy street.

41
00:02:44.474 --> 00:02:49.097
Several uniformed men joined the chase behind the monkey trainer.

42
00:02:49.117 --> 00:02:51.999
"Stop—in the name of the Emperor!"

43
00:02:52.719 --> 00:02:55.200
shouted one guard, holding a club.

44
00:02:56.801 --> 00:03:00.644
Mandy and Jinying slowed down, gasping for breath.

45
00:03:02.064 --> 00:03:04.726
The monkey trainer also pulled up his horse.

46
00:03:06.147 --> 00:03:07.348
"Who are those men?"

47
00:03:08.008 --> 00:03:08.769
asked Mandy.

48
00:03:08.789 --> 00:03:13.472
"The Gold Bird Guards," panted Jinying.

49
00:03:13.492 --> 00:03:16.394
"They control traffic on the streets."

50
00:03:16.414 --> 00:03:19.256
"What is the problem here?"

51
00:03:19.956 --> 00:03:21.297
a guard asked Mandy.

52
00:03:21.317 --> 00:03:23.619
"She's a thief!"

53
00:03:24.359 --> 00:03:25.360
yelled the trainer.

54
00:03:25.380 --> 00:03:27.462
"She stole my monkey!"

55
00:03:27.482 --> 00:03:29.263
"Is this true?"

56
00:03:30.023 --> 00:03:30.844
asked the guard.

57
00:03:32.032 --> 00:03:36.556
"That man was speeding, sir," said Jinying, pointing to the trainer.

58
00:03:36.576 --> 00:03:41.580
"In Chang'an, there is a strict penalty for those who speed on the roads."

59
00:03:42.721 --> 00:03:46.664
"You were going very fast," the guard said to the trainer.

60
00:03:46.684 --> 00:03:50.808
"But but the trainer stuttered.

61
00:03:50.828 --> 00:03:53.430
"What about my monkey?"

62
00:03:54.711 --> 00:03:57.193
The monkey was clinging to Mandy's shirt.

63
00:03:57.213 --> 00:04:00.316
"Does this man speak the truth?"

64
00:04:01.084 --> 00:04:03.386
the guard asked in a threatening voice.

65
00:04:04.647 --> 00:04:06.889
Mandy's eyes filled with tears.

66
00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:11.893
She could not imagine what would happen to her and to the monkey.

67
00:04:11.913 --> 00:04:17.297
"Sir, I she began.

68
00:04:18.578 --> 00:04:20.600
Jinying suddenly stood tall.

69
00:04:20.620 --> 00:04:23.362
"This girl has broken no law!"

70
00:04:23.962 --> 00:04:25.764
he said in a strong voice.

71
00:04:27.105 --> 00:04:30.548
Another guard rode up and recognized the young man.

72
00:04:31.952 --> 00:04:33.634
"It's Master Yuan Jinying!"

73
00:04:34.235 --> 00:04:34.856
he cried.

74
00:04:36.037 --> 00:04:37.459
The guards all bowed to
